</td><td colspan="3" style="background-color:#e5edf3;padding:2px 1pt;text-align:center;vertical-align:bottom"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:5pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">29,562</span></td></tr><tr><td colspan="3" style="background-color:#e5edf3;padding:0 1pt"/><td colspan="3" style="background-color:#e5edf3;padding:2px 1pt;text-align:center;vertical-align:bottom"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:5pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">2/10/2025</span></td><td colspan="3" style="background-color:#e5edf3;padding:2px 1pt;text-align:center;vertical-align:bottom"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:5pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">2/25/2025</span></td><td colspan="3" style="background-color:#e5edf3;padding:2px 1pt;text-align:center;vertical-align:bottom"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:5pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">&#8212;</span></td><td colspan="3" style="background-color:#e5edf3;padding:2px 1pt;text-align:center;vertical-align:bottom"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:5pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">&#8212;</span></td><td colspan="3" style="background-color:#e5edf3;padding:0 1pt"/><td colspan="3" style="background-color:#e5edf3;padding:2px 1pt;text-align:center;vertical-align:bottom"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:5pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">&#8212;</span></td><td colspan="3" style="background-color:#e5edf3;padding:0 1pt"/><td colspan="3" style="background-color:#e5edf3;padding:2px 1pt;text-align:center;vertical-align:bottom"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:5pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">&#8212;</span></td><td colspan="3" style="background-color:#e5edf3;padding:2px 1pt;text-align:center;vertical-align:bottom"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:5pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">&#8212;</span></td><td colspan="3" style="background-color:#e5edf3;padding:2px 1pt;text-align:center;vertical-align:bottom"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:5pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">&#8212;</span></td><td colspan="3" style="background-color:#e5edf3;padding:2px 1pt;text-align:center;vertical-align:bottom"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:5pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">113,080</span></td><td colspan="3" style="background-color:#e5edf3;padding:2px 1pt;text-align:center;vertical-align:bottom"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:5pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">134,565</span></td></tr><tr><td colspan="3" style="padding:2px 1pt;text-align:center;vertical-align:top"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:5pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">Jeremy S. Halford</span></td><td colspan="3" style="padding:0 1pt"/><td colspan="3" style="padding:2px 1pt;text-align:center;vertical-align:bottom"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:5pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">&#8212;</span></td><td colspan="3" style="padding:2px 1pt;text-align:center;vertical-align:bottom"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:5pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">&#8212;</span></td><td colspan="3" style="padding:2px 1pt;text-align:center;vertical-align:bottom"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:5pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">449,600</span></td><td colspan="3" style="padding:0 1pt"/><td colspan="3" style="padding:2px 1pt;text-align:center;vertical-align:bottom"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:5pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">899,200</span></td><td colspan="3" style="padding:0 1pt"/><td colspan="3" style="padding:2px 1pt;text-align:center;vertical-align:bottom"><span style="color:#000